{
  "id": "07-ascend-primitive-flow",
  "title": "昇腾一次 GEMM+ReLU 的原语与存储层级",
  "caption": "每个存储层级之间的搬运都对应一条具体的 tile 原语；T.dual_copy 的职责是把 L0C 累加器按 M 或 N 切给两个 AIV。",
  "kind": "flow",
  "direction": "LR",
  "nodeMaxEm": 18,
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "gm", "label": "GM", "shape": "pill", "tone": "store" },
    { "id": "l1", "label": "L1 Buffer", "tone": "store" },
    { "id": "l0a", "label": "L0A", "tone": "store" },
    { "id": "l0b", "label": "L0B", "tone": "store" },
    { "id": "cube", "label": "Cube / AIC", "sub": "T.gemm → ascend.mad", "tone": "compute" },
    { "id": "l0c", "label": "L0C", "tone": "store" },
    {
      "id": "ubvf",
      "label": "UB ⇄ Vector / AIV",
      "sub": "T.SimtVF / T.SimdVF 就地做 ReLU",
      "tone": "compute"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "gm", "to": "l1", "label": "T.copy" },
    { "from": "l1", "to": "l0a", "label": "T.copy" },
    { "from": "l1", "to": "l0b", "label": "T.copy" },
    { "from": "l0a", "to": "cube" },
    { "from": "l0b", "to": "cube" },
    { "from": "cube", "to": "l0c" },
    { "from": "l0c", "to": "ubvf", "label": "T.dual_copy（M/N 各半）" },
    { "from": "ubvf", "to": "gm", "label": "T.dual_copy / T.copy" }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "T.dual_copy 在这里把 L0C 累加器按 M 或 N 切开交给两个 AIV，否则 Vector 侧只有一半并行度。",
    "它不是「把纯 Vector kernel 变成双 AIV」的开关：用户必须同时提供 Cube 侧的工作。"
  ]
